    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dicealot is a Farkle inspired roguelike dice-builder where you will gather the finest hands of fantastical dice to hit hard and save the kingdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/d10deb5505fcd1b7b968e95e74b1036c.poster.avif?t=1752584117\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/d10deb5505fcd1b7b968e95e74b1036c.webm?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/d10deb5505fcd1b7b968e95e74b1036c.mp4?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find power dice combos within your rolls to rack up points! Be beware, for the more you roll, the greater the risk, so you\u2019ll need nerves of steel to keep rolling when you could <strong>farkle and lose it all! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/02141e2b0446b393b34827b0dcaf90a5.poster.avif?t=1752584117\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/02141e2b0446b393b34827b0dcaf90a5.webm?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/02141e2b0446b393b34827b0dcaf90a5.mp4?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fear not! You will have an array of unique <strong>quest dice</strong> to help you reach the biggest of big numbers and squash your foes. But finding the right dice for your build is only half the challenge, you\u2019ll want to avoid some of those undesirable rolls!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/8b86bc22ed18b6fc5b1521a07478977c.poster.avif?t=1752584117\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/8b86bc22ed18b6fc5b1521a07478977c.webm?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/8b86bc22ed18b6fc5b1521a07478977c.mp4?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Camelot!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King Arthur is mysteriously bewitched! Play as Queen Gwynevere rounding up his faithful Knights to root out the source of his majesty's malady.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on an eclectic cast of Arthurian foes that are sure to keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/99b2c46178b57dfb44fa6a8a0acb6038.poster.avif?t=1752584117\" width=600 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/99b2c46178b57dfb44fa6a8a0acb6038.webm?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/99b2c46178b57dfb44fa6a8a0acb6038.mp4?t=1752584117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farkle based roguelike combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a Camalot in turmoil </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on over 30 foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your deck with 70+ unique dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 10 weapons all with their own unique abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the difficulty to suit your needs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy endless replay-ability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So come and test your skill and your luck, and see if you have the dice to save the Kingdom!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dicealot is inspired by other amazing games: Balatro, Monster Train, Slay the Spire,\u00a0Inscryption, Dicey Dungeons and many other amazing deck builders! Check them out too if you have not already!\u00a0</p>",
